-- en/10-file-upload-help/exit --
0
-- en/10-file-upload-help/stdout --
Stream one local regular file to a path below user, public, or account storage.

Usage:
  crater file upload <local-file> <remote-path> [flags]

Flags:
      --overwrite   Replace an existing remote file

Global Flags:
  -h, --help             Help for crater
      --json             Output in raw JSON format
      --no-interactive   Disable interactive prompts
-- en/10-file-upload-help/stderr --
