-- en/22-file-rm-help/stdout --
Remove exactly one remote entry below user, public, or account storage. Directories require --recursive.

Usage:
  crater file rm <remote-path> [flags]

Flags:
      --recursive   Remove a directory and all of its contents
  -y, --yes         Remove without confirmation

Global Flags:
  -h, --help             Help for crater
      --json             Output in raw JSON format
      --no-interactive   Disable interactive prompts
-- en/22-file-rm-help/stderr --
